s": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Marble Swoop", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Marble Swoop'a ho\u015f geldiniz \u2014 Meta Quest i\u00e7in \u00f6zel olarak tasarlanm\u0131\u015f, s\u00fcr\u00fckleyici bir VR aksiyon-bulmaca deneyimi!\n\nAntik arenalara ad\u0131m at\u0131n ve yuvarlanan mermer raylar\u0131n\u0131n kontrol\u00fcn\u00fc elinize al\u0131n. G\u00f6reviniz basit ama yo\u011fun: renkli toplar\u0131 e\u015fle\u015ftirin, devasa zincir reaksiyonlar\u0131 ba\u015flat\u0131n ve hareketli mermer treni antik kap\u0131lara ula\u015fmadan durdurun.\n\n\u00d6ne \u00c7\u0131kan \u00d6zellikler:\n- \u0130ki D\u00fcnya, 60+ El Yap\u0131m\u0131 Level: Antik'in g\u00fcne\u015fli arenalar\u0131n\u0131 ve Neon'un parlayan kristal arenalar\u0131n\u0131 fethedin \u2014 stratejik olarak dengelenmi\u015f tasar\u0131mlar, m\u00fckemmel \u015fekilde \u00f6l\u00e7eklenen zorluk e\u011frisi ve s\u00fcrekli g\u00fcncellenen meydan okumalar.\n- \u00c7e\u015fitli G\u00fc\u00e7lendirmeler ve \u00d6zel Silahlar: Slow-Mo, Stop, Rewind, Paint, Guided Aim, y\u0131k\u0131c\u0131 Marbles Bombs ve h\u0131zl\u0131 ate\u015f eden Minigun ile b\u00fcy\u00fck y\u0131k\u0131m\u0131 serbest b\u0131rak\u0131n!\n- Ger\u00e7ek VR Deneyimi: Quest cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in tamamen optimize edildi. Ayakta veya oturarak oynay\u0131n; hassas g\u00f6z seviyesi perspektifi ve ak\u0131c\u0131 fizik.\n- K\u00fcresel Yerelle\u015ftirme: \u0130ngilizce, T\u00fcrk\u00e7e, Frans\u0131zca, \u0130spanyolca, \u0130talyanca ve Almanca dahil birden fazla dilde sorunsuz kullan\u0131m.\n- G\u00fcvenli \u0130lerleme ve K\u00fcnye: Tam bulut/yerel kay\u0131t verisi korumas\u0131 ve ayr\u0131lm\u0131\u015f k\u00fcnye b\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fc.\n\nAntik yollar\u0131 temizleyip en b\u00fcy\u00fck mermer ustas\u0131 olabilir misiniz? Marble Swoop'u \u015fimdi indirin ve reflekslerinizi test edin!", "short_description": "En iyi VR aksiyon-bulmaca deneyimini ya\u015fay\u0131n. Renkleri e\u015fle\u015ftirin, yuvarlanan toplar\u0131 patlat\u0131n, g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc \u00f6zel silahlar kullan\u0131n ve etkileyici bir sanal ger\u00e7eklik ortam\u0131nda zorlu arenalar\u0131 fethedin!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE.png", "id": "2081866609098424", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_2081866615765090_949015110819556091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3FTtMAINfbwQ7kNvwF4ZCqX&_nc_oc=Adqw-uTEPJHGkptagM4QT0srBsUI1uNHz_bDkq7C9wBypgk1t9JWMr6y8zZA5a831Bs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSt7ZPtYZs6RFrynaRbDQ3JspkMkjISQFOcV274SVJILg&oe=6B007BD4"}, {"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE.png", "id": "1850325272626143", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1850325279292809_2295178359030808781_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x39RF-Oa0FoQ7kNvwHY4qS3&_nc_oc=AdqcUEj03sBk6JW24E_SjG2FUtxK46Iv5tnBWWDuyRQQf2zety6NJGaQHWc3jLY5hCc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSOIX0tit0z9ZHIZRN_XIO71CiOPcv2_wv6Yc5dgCFnKw&oe=6B007ADD"}, {"file_name": "AppIcon.png", "id": "1782468070546761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825462_1782468073880094_6805242865374174053_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rdlt89TYtMUQ7kNvwFYR34I&_nc_oc=Adp9H-BoqRYvY1Jw5IXqJ9ZdHENzhJoEsdIOkFsRk9ZA1009SMmr5Z_NAd8tO1MQkrc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRVHnPdcil30ErykT0bXDyFCLPHhUE30bok6ImTv_lJfw&oe=6B0075BA"}, {"file_name": "marble_swoop_cover_portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "1608267824284878", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827960_1608267827618211_2361794878565451425_